LANGUAGE English

BOOK SearchFluxStabilizer ORDERED NO KEEP LOOPED
	TRIGGERED BY @SearchFluxStabilizer

	PAGE Start
		IF test THEN TRIGGER @askAboutGate
	
		PROLOG "A small device with gears, hoses, and lights sits on the table."
		
		BUTTON "Search"
	
		TEXT """
			As you reach down to pick it up, the device sparks and booms,
			generating a pressure wave that pushes all
			investigators--including you--1 space away from the
			{c:QItemFluxStabilizer}.

			{c:EventChosenInvestigator} recovers first and stands back up. As
			they approach the device, nothing happens. Move
			{c:EventChosenInvestigator} into the {c:QItemFluxStabilizer}'s space.

			The other investigators are wary of this device and will avoid it at
			all costs. When it is not held by {c:EventChosenInvestigator}, no
			other investigator can stay in its space, fear making them
			move away immediately.
		"""
		
		// wanderers are the cultist who seem to be coming from the secret
		// passageway off the study.
		wandererMax = #heros - exploredBackyardNicely
		wandererFrequency = 2
	END Start
	
	PAGE Finn
		IF #HeroFinnEdwards THEN PAGE IS VISIBLE
		
		TEXT """
			Finn Edwards vision comes back into focus:  he is on the ground
			where he fell. As his vision clears, he feels different. He feels...
			off. Finn can no longer use his special ability

			As he starts to push himself up, he puts his hand down in the wrong
			place. When he looks at what he hit, he gains the
			{c:QItemBrassKnuckles} Common Item. As he plays
			with them, they make him feel more confident. Improve Finn’s {strength}.
		"""
	END Finn
	
	PAGE Kate
		IF #HeroKateWinthrop THEN PAGE IS VISIBLE
		
		TEXT "Will Kate pick up the {c:QItemFluxStabilizer}?"
		
		PASS "Yes"
		FAIL "No"
		
		TEST ON PASS GOTO KatePicksUp ON FAIL GOTO KateDoesNotPickUp
	END Kate

	PAGE KatePicksUp
		PAGE IS NOT VISIBLE
		
		TEXT """
			Kate is overjoyed that she will have a {c:QItemFluxStablizer} again,
			especially one this powerful.
			
			Looking at it, she calms down and loses her focusing anger. Kate no
			longer becomes Focused when she is attacked.
		"""
	END KatePicksUp
	
	PAGE KateDoesNotPickUp
		PAGE IS NOT VISIBLE
		
		TEXT """
			Kate quietly seethes to herself at the unfairness:  the
			{c:QItemFluxStabilizer} should be hers. Kate becomes Focused.
		"""
	END KateDoesNotPickUp

	PAGE Paper
		TEXT """
			There is a piece of paper next to the device: instructions. It's called a
			<<{c:QItemFluxStabilizer},>> and it repels monsters. "MONSTERS!?"
			you erupt loudly.

			Everyone turns to look at you.
		"""
		
		EXIT
	END Paper

	PAGE Puzzle1
		TEXT """
			The device just sits there, not doing anything. There seems to be a
			control panel. Maybe you can restart it? You reach down and start
			fiddling with the buttons and dials.

			{c:EventChosenInvestigator} may attempt the puzzle using {lore}.
		"""
		
		TRIGGER @AttemptFluxStabilizerPuzzle
	END Puzzle1

	PAGE Puzzle2
		TEXT """
			Maybe if you randomly flipped a few more buttons or turned a few
			more dials, it would do something.
			
			{c:EventChosenInvestigator} can attempt it again using {lore}.
		"""
		
		TRIGGER @AttemptFluxStabilizerPuzzle
		MARK UNREAD
	END Puzzle2

END SearchFluxStabilizer
